---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/`;

const gallery = [
  {
    src: `${base}images/line_tracking_duck/line_tracking_robot_mvp.jpg`,
    alt: "Early line-tracking robot prototype showing its electronics and wiring",
    caption: "ELECTRONICS · EARLY PROTOTYPE",
  },
  {
    src: `${base}images/line_tracking_duck/line_tracking_robot_v3.jpg`,
    alt: "Third iteration of the yellow Robo-Duck with separated printed body and chassis",
    caption: "THIRD ITERATION · MODULAR BODY",
    featured: true,
  },
  {
    src: `${base}images/line_tracking_duck/line_tracking_robot_pattern.jpg`,
    alt: "Robo-Duck following a black line pattern during testing",
    caption: "LINE-FOLLOWING TEST",
  },
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Qin Bei's line-tracking Robo-Duck project: a 3D-printed autonomous robot developed through rapid prototyping, electronics integration, and testing."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f5ef" />
    <title>Line-Tracking Robo-Duck — Qin Bei</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="nav">
      <a class="wordmark" href={base}>Qin Bei<span>.</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href={`${base}#work`}>Projects</a>
        <a href={`${base}#about`}>About</a>
        <a href={`${base}#experience`}>Experience</a>
        <a href={`${base}#contact`}>Contact ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="project-header">
        <a class="back-link" href={`${base}#work`}>← All projects</a>
        <p class="eyebrow">ROBOTICS · MECHANICAL DESIGN</p>
        <h1>Line-Tracking<br />Robo-Duck<span>.</span></h1>

        <div class="project-meta">
          <div>
            <span class="meta-label">TIMELINE</span>
            <p>June 2024</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="meta-label">ROLE</span>
            <p>Mechanical Design · Prototyping</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="meta-label">TOOLS</span>
            <p>Fusion 360 · Arduino IDE · 3D Printing · Wiring · Soldering</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="meta-label">GROUP</span>
            <p>Mahir K.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-overview section">
        <div class="section-index">01</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>Project overview</h2>
          <p>
            As part of a week-long electrical and computer engineering
            workshop at the University of Toronto, my partner and I created
            an autonomous robot capable of navigating complex line patterns.
            We integrated microcontrollers, motor shields, servo motors, LEDs,
            and infrared sensors to achieve reliable line tracking.
          </p>
          <p>
            Under a tight timeline, we optimized the robot body for 3D
            printing and rapid iteration, balancing functionality with ease
            of manufacturing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contributions-section section">
        <div class="section-index">02</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>My contributions</h2>
          <div class="contributions-grid">
            <article class="contribution">
              <div class="contribution-icon sage" aria-hidden="true">◇</div>
              <div class="contribution-copy">
                <p class="contribution-category">MECHANICAL DESIGN</p>
                <h3>Designed for 3D printing</h3>
                <p class="contribution-description">
                  Helped design and prototype the Robo-Duck body, optimizing it
                  for quick printing, assembly, and iteration.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="contribution">
              <div class="contribution-icon blue" aria-hidden="true">○</div>
              <div class="contribution-copy">
                <p class="contribution-category">ELECTRONICS INTEGRATION</p>
                <h3>Integrated robot systems</h3>
                <p class="contribution-description">
                  Worked with microcontrollers, motor shields, servo motors,
                  LEDs, and infrared sensors to support autonomous navigation.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="contribution">
              <div class="contribution-icon yellow" aria-hidden="true">＋</div>
              <div class="contribution-copy">
                <p class="contribution-category">PROTOTYPING &amp; TESTING</p>
                <h3>Refined through testing</h3>
                <p class="contribution-description">
                  Iterated on the design and tested sensor calibration, motor
                  control, speed, and system reliability with my project partner.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="results-section section">
        <div class="section-index">03</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>Results</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">
            Iterative design and testing led to strong results in the workshop
            challenges.
          </p>
          <div class="results-grid">
            <article class="result">
              <span class="result-number">3<span>rd</span></span>
              <p class="result-title">Preliminary line-tracking challenge</p>
              <p class="result-detail">
                Placed third after multiple design and strategy iterations.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="result">
              <span class="result-number result-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
              <p class="result-title">Most creative design</p>
              <p class="result-detail">
                Won the creativity award while competing against ten other
                teams.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="result">
              <span class="result-number result-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↻</span>
              <p class="result-title">Rapid design iteration and testing</p>
              <p class="result-detail">
                A 3D-printable design supported fast prototyping and testing
                during the one-week workshop.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="gallery-section section">
        <div class="section-index">04</div>
        <div class="section-content">
          <div class="gallery-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED PROJECT IMAGES</p>
              <h2>Prototype &amp; testing<span>.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <span class="image-count">{gallery.length} IMAGES</span>
          </div>

          <div class="gallery-grid">
            {gallery.map((item, index) => (
              <figure class:list={["gallery-item", item.featured && "featured"]}>
                <a
                  class="gallery-image"
                  href={item.src}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noreferrer"
                  aria-label={`Open full-size image: ${item.alt}`}
                >
                  <img src={item.src} alt={item.alt} loading="lazy" />
                  <span class="image-open" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                </a>
                <figcaption>
                  <span>{item.caption}</span>
                  <span class="image-index">
                    {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
                  </span>
                </figcaption>
              </figure>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="next-project">
        <p class="eyebrow">MORE PROJECTS</p>
        <h2>More things I've been building<span>.</span></h2>
        <a href={`${base}#work`}>Back to selected projects ↗</a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a class="wordmark" href={base}>Qin Bei<span>.</span></a>
      <span>MECHANICAL ENGINEERING</span>
      <a href={`${base}#contact`}>GET IN TOUCH ↗</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 80px;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f5ef;
    color: #252620;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav,
  footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 22px 5.5%;
  }

  .nav {
    min-height: 72px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dedbd2;
  }

  .wordmark {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.7px;
  }

  .wordmark span,
  h1 span,
  h2 span {
    color: #648365;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: clamp(18px, 3vw, 42px);
  }

  nav a,
  .back-link {
    color: #55574f;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  nav a:hover,
  .back-link:hover {
    color: #648365;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .meta-label {
    color: #72766b;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1.4px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .project-header,
  .next-project {
    padding: 34px 5.5%;
  }

  .section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);
    column-gap: 14px;
    margin: 0 5.5%;
    padding: 30px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #dedbd2;
  }

  .section-index {
    padding-top: 3px;
    color: #648365;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .section-content {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .project-header > .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 76px);
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
  }

  .project-meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1fr 1.6fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #dedbd2;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dedbd2;
  }

  .project-meta > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 7px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .project-meta > div + div {
    padding-left: 24px;
    border-left: 1px solid #d7d4cb;
  }

  .project-meta p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.1vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .section-content > p:not(.eyebrow),
  .section-intro,
  .contribution-description,
  .results-grid p {
    color: #65675e;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .section-content > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .section-content > p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: -4px 0 24px;
  }

  .contributions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .contribution {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 36px minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-content: start;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0 22px;
  }

  .contribution:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .contribution:last-child {
    padding-right: 0;
  }

  .contribution + .contribution {
    border-left: 1px solid #d7d4cb;
  }

  .contribution-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #354b39;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .sage { background: #e1e7d7; }
  .blue { background: #dce6ef; color: #354a61; }
  .yellow { background: #f8e6bc; color: #765a24; }

  .contribution-copy { min-width: 0; }

  .contribution-category {
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    color: #72766b;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.9px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .contribution h3 {
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .contribution-description {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .results-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .results-grid article {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .result-number,
  .result-symbol {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #252620;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 54px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .result-number span {
    margin-left: 0.04em;
    color: #648365;
    font-size: 0.55em;
  }

  .result-symbol {
    color: #648365;
  }

  .result-title {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #252620;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .results-grid .result-title {
    color: #252620;
  }

  .result-detail {
    margin: 0;
    color: #65675e;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .gallery-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .gallery-heading .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .gallery-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .image-count {
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    color: #72766b;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 26px 18px;
  }

  .gallery-item {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gallery-item.featured {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .gallery-image {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #e8e5dc;
  }

  .gallery-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1.2 / 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 250ms ease;
  }

  .featured .gallery-image img {
    aspect-ratio: 1.55 / 1;
  }

  .gallery-image:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.025);
  }

  .image-open {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f7f5ef;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 180ms ease;
  }

  .gallery-image:hover .image-open,
  .gallery-image:focus-visible .image-open {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  figcaption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    color: #65675e;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.7px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .image-index {
    color: #648365;
  }

  .next-project {
    background: #eee9dc;
  }

  .next-project .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .next-project h2 {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .next-project > a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 7px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #999b8d;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  footer {
    color: #77786f;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.7px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1500px) {
    .nav,
    .project-header,
    .next-project,
    footer {
      padding-left: max(5.5%, calc((100% - 1320px) / 2));
      padding-right: max(5.5%, calc((100% - 1320px) / 2));
    }

    .section {
      margin-left: max(5.5%, calc((100% - 1320px) / 2));
      margin-right: max(5.5%, calc((100% - 1320px) / 2));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .project-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .project-meta > div + div {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .project-meta > div:nth-child(even) {
      padding-left: 16px;
      border-left: 1px solid #d7d4cb;
    }

    .results-grid,
    .contributions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .contribution,
    .contribution:first-child,
    .contribution:last-child {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .contribution + .contribution {
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #d7d4cb;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .contribution + .contribution .contribution-copy {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .nav,
    footer {
      padding-left: 5%;
      padding-right: 5%;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 13px;
    }

    nav a {
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .project-header,
    .next-project {
      padding: 26px 5%;
    }

    .section {
      margin-left: 5%;
      margin-right: 5%;
      padding: 26px 0;
    }

    .project-meta {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .project-meta > div + div {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .gallery-item.featured {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .gallery-heading {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    footer {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }

    .gallery-image img,
    .image-open {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
